00:23:32,800 --> 00:23:39,359
spoke. Hectic spots of red burned on his cheeks. He was terribly excited. Lord

266
00:23:39,359 --> 00:23:42,679
Henry watched him with a subtle sense of pleasure.

267
00:23:42,679 --> 00:23:48,118
How different he was now from the shy frightened boy he had met in Basil hallwood

268
00:23:48,118 --> 00:23:54,118
studio! His nature had developed like a flower, had borne blossoms of scarlet

