309
00:27:30,078 --> 00:27:38,639
about tomorrow goodbye As he left the room, Lord Henry’s heavy eyelids drooped, and he began to

310
00:27:38,639 --> 00:27:44,078
think. Certainly few people had ever interested him so much as Dorian Gray,

311
00:27:44,078 --> 00:27:48,158
and yet the lad’s mad adoration of someone else caused him not the

