00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:21,719
the one thing worth investigating. Compared to it there was nothing else of any

318
00:28:21,719 --> 00:28:27,078
value. It was true that as one watched life in its curious crucible of pain and

319
00:28:27,078 --> 00:28:32,238
pleasure, one could not wear over one’s face a mask of glass, nor keep the

320
00:28:32,238 --> 00:28:37,319
sulfurous fumes from troubling the brain and making the imagination turbid with

321
00:28:37,319 --> 00:28:43,679
monstrous fancies and misshapen dreams. There were poisons so subtle that

322
00:28:43,679 --> 00:28:48,439
to know their properties one had to sicken of them. There were maladies so

