00:28:48,439 --> 00:28:52,800
strange that one had to pass through them if one sought to understand their

324
00:28:52,800 --> 00:28:58,639
nature. And, yet, what a great reward one received! How wonderful the whole world

325
00:28:58,639 --> 00:29:04,198
became to one! To note the curious hard logic of passion, and the emotional

