00:29:04,198 --> 00:29:09,679
colored life of the intellect— —to observe where they met, and where they separated,

327
00:29:09,679 --> 00:29:14,319
at what point they were in unison, and at what point they were at discord— —there

328
00:29:14,319 --> 00:29:19,319
was a delight in that! What matter what the cost was? One could never pay too

