00:29:19,319 --> 00:29:24,359
high a price for any sensation. He was conscious— —and the

330
00:29:24,359 --> 00:29:29,359
thought brought a gleam of pleasure into his brown agot eyes— —that it was through

331
00:29:29,359 --> 00:29:35,118
certain words of his, musical words said with musical utterance, that Dorian

332
00:29:35,118 --> 00:29:40,639
Gray’s soul had turned to this white girl and bowed in worship before

333
00:29:40,639 --> 00:29:47,359
her. To a large extent the lad was his own creation. He had made him premature. That

